'''Big Air Balloon''' (Japanese: '''大きなふうせん''' ''Big Balloon'') is a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool card}} in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Tool
|rule=Pocket Tool
|effect=The {{TCG|Stage 2 Pokémon}} this card is attached to has no {{TCG|Retreat Cost}}.
}}

==Trivia==
This card's effect is identical to that of the {{TCG|Big Air Balloon}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].

===Origin===
* This card depicts a larger version of an [[Air Balloon]], an item from the [[core series]] [[Pokémon game]]s.
* This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|151|Big Air Balloon|155}} from the {{TCG|151}} expansion.

